{"type": "project", "schema_version": 1, "topic": "MySQL 的 B+ 树索引", "audience": "会基本 SQL 的数据库初学者", "target_seconds": 300, "post": {"title": "查一笔订单要翻几页？五分钟看懂 MySQL 的 B+ 树索引", "description": "用一张订单表逐页追踪 InnoDB 如何查主键、扫范围、回表和覆盖查询，再看插入时的一次页分裂。页编号、记录分布和金额为教学示例。动画及配音由 AI 辅助制作。", "tags": ["MySQL", "数据库", "B+树", "InnoDB", "索引", "SQL"]}, "sources": [{"id": "structure", "title": "MySQL 8.4 手册 · InnoDB 索引的物理结构", "url": "https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-physical-structure.html"}, {"id": "cluster", "title": "MySQL 8.4 手册 · 聚簇索引与二级索引", "url": "https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-index-types.html"}, {"id": "buffer", "title": "MySQL 8.4 手册 · 缓冲池", "url": "https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/innodb-buffer-pool.html"}, {"id": "covering", "title": "MySQL 8.4 手册 · MySQL 如何使用索引", "url": "https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/mysql-indexes.html"}, {"id": "tree", "title": "MySQL Server · InnoDB B-tree 页导航与分裂实现", "url": "https://github.com/mysql/mysql-server/blob/8.4/storage/innobase/btr/btr0btr.cc"}]}
{"type": "scene", "id": "case", "kind": "html", "title": "MySQL 的 B+ 树索引"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-1a", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 2100, "text": "订单表里有一百万行。", "caption": "订单表里有一百万行。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-1b", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 2100, "planned_end_ms": 5460, "text": "客服要查一笔，数据库会从头翻吗？", "caption": "客服要查一笔，数据库会从头翻吗？", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-case-1", "scene_id": "case", "target": "case-view", "planned_start_ms": 0, "planned_end_ms": 5460, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-1a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-1b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-2a", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 5460, "planned_end_ms": 8610, "text": "她手里只有一个订单号，四十二。", "caption": "她手里只有一个订单号，42。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-2b", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 8610, "planned_end_ms": 11550, "text": "主键是唯一的，最多命中一笔。", "caption": "主键是唯一的，最多命中一笔。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-case-2", "scene_id": "case", "target": "case-view", "planned_start_ms": 5460, "planned_end_ms": 11550, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-2a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-2b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-3a", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 11550, "planned_end_ms": 14490, "text": "把表铺开，数据分在许多页里。", "caption": "把表铺开，数据分在许多页里。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-3b", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 14490, "planned_end_ms": 18270, "text": "挨页翻，大部分读进来的订单都用不上。", "caption": "挨页翻，大部分读进来的订单都用不上。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-case-3", "scene_id": "case", "target": "case-view", "planned_start_ms": 11550, "planned_end_ms": 18270, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-3a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-3b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-4a", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 18270, "planned_end_ms": 20790, "text": "我们给订单号定义了主键。", "caption": "我们给订单号定义了主键。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-4b", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 20790, "planned_end_ms": 27090, "text": "在这张 InnoDB 表里，订单按主键组织成一棵 B 加树。", "caption": "在这张 InnoDB 表里，订单按主键组织成一棵 B+ 树。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-case-4", "scene_id": "case", "target": "case-view", "planned_start_ms": 18270, "planned_end_ms": 27090, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-4a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-4b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-5a", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 27090, "planned_end_ms": 29610, "text": "现在把自己放进数据库里。", "caption": "现在把自己放进数据库里。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "case-5b", "scene_id": "case", "planned_start_ms": 29610, "planned_end_ms": 32340, "text": "要找出金额，得打开哪几页。", "caption": "要找出金额，得打开哪几页。", "source_ids": ["structure", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-case-5", "scene_id": "case", "target": "case-view", "planned_start_ms": 27090, "planned_end_ms": 32340, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-5a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "case-5b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "pages", "kind": "html", "title": "把一个索引页拆开看"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-1a", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 32973, "planned_end_ms": 36753, "text": "放大看，树上一个节点就是一个索引页。", "caption": "放大看，树上一个节点就是一个索引页。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-1b", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 36753, "planned_end_ms": 40113, "text": "一页能装很多条目，图里只画几条。", "caption": "一页能装很多条目，图里只画几条。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-pages-1", "scene_id": "pages", "target": "pages-view", "planned_start_ms": 32973, "planned_end_ms": 40113, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-1a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-1b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-2a", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 40113, "planned_end_ms": 45783, "text": "默认一页是十六个千字节，也就是一万六千三百八十四字节。", "caption": "默认一页是16 KiB，也就是16,384字节。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-2b", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 45783, "planned_end_ms": 48933, "text": "读进内存之后，可以在页里查找。", "caption": "读进内存之后，可以在页里查找。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-pages-2", "scene_id": "pages", "target": "pages-view", "planned_start_ms": 40113, "planned_end_ms": 48933, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-2a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-2b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-3a", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 48933, "planned_end_ms": 51873, "text": "内部页存着分隔键和子页编号。", "caption": "内部页存着分隔键和子页编号。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-3b", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 51873, "planned_end_ms": 55233, "text": "比较键值，就能确定去下面哪一页。", "caption": "比较键值，就能确定去下面哪一页。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-pages-3", "scene_id": "pages", "target": "pages-view", "planned_start_ms": 48933, "planned_end_ms": 55233, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-3a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-3b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-4a", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 55233, "planned_end_ms": 57333, "text": "再看主键树的叶子页。", "caption": "再看主键树的叶子页。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-4b", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 57333, "planned_end_ms": 61953, "text": "四十二号的行数据就在这儿。已支付，八十八元。", "caption": "42号的行数据就在这儿。已支付，88元。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-pages-4", "scene_id": "pages", "target": "pages-view", "planned_start_ms": 55233, "planned_end_ms": 61953, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-4a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-4b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-5a", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 61953, "planned_end_ms": 66363, "text": "内部页能指向许多子页，几层就能管很多数据。", "caption": "内部页能指向许多子页，几层就能管很多数据。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "pages-5b", "scene_id": "pages", "planned_start_ms": 66363, "planned_end_ms": 69303, "text": "能分多少路，取决于条目大小。", "caption": "能分多少路，取决于条目大小。", "source_ids": ["structure", "tree", "cluster"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-pages-5", "scene_id": "pages", "target": "pages-view", "planned_start_ms": 61953, "planned_end_ms": 69303, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-5a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "pages-5b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "seek", "kind": "html", "title": "一次等值查询，逐层缩小范围"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-1a", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 69936, "planned_end_ms": 73086, "text": "回到四十二号订单。从根页开始。", "caption": "回到42号订单。从根页开始。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-1b", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 73086, "planned_end_ms": 76656, "text": "盯住四十二，看每次比较还剩哪一段。", "caption": "盯住42，看每次比较还剩哪一段。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-seek-1", "scene_id": "seek", "target": "seek-view", "planned_start_ms": 69936, "planned_end_ms": 76656, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-1a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-1b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-2a", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 76656, "planned_end_ms": 79596, "text": "根页的两个分界是三十和六十。", "caption": "根页的两个分界是30和60。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-2b", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 79596, "planned_end_ms": 83166, "text": "四十二落在中间，沿子页编号往下走。", "caption": "42落在中间，沿子页编号往下走。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-seek-2", "scene_id": "seek", "target": "seek-view", "planned_start_ms": 76656, "planned_end_ms": 83166, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-2a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-2b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-3a", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 83166, "planned_end_ms": 86106, "text": "下一页再用四十和四十九分界。", "caption": "下一页再用40和49分界。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-3b", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 86106, "planned_end_ms": 91356, "text": "四十二在四十到四十九之间，不含右端，进入对应叶页。", "caption": "42在40到49之间，不含右端，进入对应叶页。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-seek-3", "scene_id": "seek", "target": "seek-view", "planned_start_ms": 83166, "planned_end_ms": 91356, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-3a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-3b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-4a", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 91356, "planned_end_ms": 94296, "text": "这页有四十、四十二、四十七。", "caption": "这页有40、42、47。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-4b", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 94296, "planned_end_ms": 98916, "text": "定位到四十二，读出订单行。其他叶页都跳过了。", "caption": "定位到42，读出订单行。其他叶页都跳过了。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-seek-4", "scene_id": "seek", "target": "seek-view", "planned_start_ms": 91356, "planned_end_ms": 98916, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-4a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-4b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-5a", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 98916, "planned_end_ms": 102906, "text": "这次路径有三页。会发生三次磁盘读取吗？", "caption": "这次路径有三页。会发生三次磁盘读取吗？", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "seek-5b", "scene_id": "seek", "planned_start_ms": 102906, "planned_end_ms": 107316, "text": "还得看缓冲池，命中的页可以直接从内存读取。", "caption": "还得看缓冲池，命中的页可以直接从内存读取。", "source_ids": ["tree", "cluster", "buffer"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-seek-5", "scene_id": "seek", "target": "seek-view", "planned_start_ms": 98916, "planned_end_ms": 107316, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-5a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "seek-5b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "range", "kind": "html", "title": "范围查询，沿叶子页继续走"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-1a", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 107949, "planned_end_ms": 111729, "text": "客服改查四十号起、五十号以前的订单。", "caption": "客服改查40号起、50号以前的订单。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-1b", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 111729, "planned_end_ms": 114459, "text": "起点含四十，终点不含五十。", "caption": "起点含40，终点不含50。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-range-1", "scene_id": "range", "target": "range-view", "planned_start_ms": 107949, "planned_end_ms": 114459, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-1a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-1b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-2a", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 114459, "planned_end_ms": 118869, "text": "先沿主键树找到第一条符合条件的记录，四十。", "caption": "先沿主键树找到第一条符合条件的记录，40。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-2b", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 118869, "planned_end_ms": 122019, "text": "找起点，和刚才的单笔查询一样。", "caption": "找起点，和刚才的单笔查询一样。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-range-2", "scene_id": "range", "target": "range-view", "planned_start_ms": 114459, "planned_end_ms": 122019, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-2a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-2b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-3a", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 122019, "planned_end_ms": 126849, "text": "从四十往后，页内按主键顺序读出四十二、四十七。", "caption": "从40往后，页内按主键顺序读出42、47。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-3b", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 126849, "planned_end_ms": 129369, "text": "到页尾了，范围却没读完。", "caption": "到页尾了，范围却没读完。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-range-3", "scene_id": "range", "target": "range-view", "planned_start_ms": 122019, "planned_end_ms": 129369, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-3a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-3b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-4a", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 129369, "planned_end_ms": 134829, "text": "叶子页之间有链接。顺着下一页读到四十九，再看到五十。", "caption": "叶子页之间有链接。顺着下一页读到49，再看到50。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-4b", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 134829, "planned_end_ms": 137979, "text": "到了上界，这次扫描就可以停下。", "caption": "到了上界，这次扫描就可以停下。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-range-4", "scene_id": "range", "target": "range-view", "planned_start_ms": 129369, "planned_end_ms": 137979, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-4a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-4b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-5a", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 137979, "planned_end_ms": 141969, "text": "留下的是四十、四十二、四十七和四十九。", "caption": "留下的是40、42、47和49。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "range-5b", "scene_id": "range", "planned_start_ms": 141969, "planned_end_ms": 147009, "text": "先定位一次，再顺着读，不用为每笔订单都从根找起。", "caption": "先定位一次，再顺着读，不用为每笔订单都从根找起。", "source_ids": ["tree", "covering"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-range-5", "scene_id": "range", "target": "range-view", "planned_start_ms": 137979, "planned_end_ms": 147009, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-5a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "range-5b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "scene", "id": "secondary", "kind": "html", "title": "换个查询条件，为什么要回表？"}
{"type": "speak", "id": "secondary-1a", "scene_id": "secondary", "planned_start_ms": 147642, "planned_end_ms": 151422, "text": "这回客服不知道订单号，只知道客户号。", "caption": "这回客服不知道订单号，只知道客户号。", "source_ids": ["cluster", "tree"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "secondary-1b", "scene_id": "secondary", "planned_start_ms": 151422, "planned_end_ms": 155412, "text": "给客户号建一个二级索引，它有自己的树。", "caption": "给客户号建一个二级索引，它有自己的树。", "source_ids": ["cluster", "tree"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-secondary-1", "scene_id": "secondary", "target": "secondary-view", "planned_start_ms": 147642, "planned_end_ms": 155412, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "secondary-1a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "secondary-1b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "secondary-2a", "scene_id": "secondary", "planned_start_ms": 155412, "planned_end_ms": 159192, "text": "假设查询采用这个索引。先找客户七号。", "caption": "假设查询采用这个索引。先找客户 7 号。", "source_ids": ["cluster", "tree"]}
{"type": "speak", "id": "secondary-2b", "scene_id": "secondary", "planned_start_ms": 159192, "planned_end_ms": 163602, "text": "同一个人可能下过好几单，命中后还要接着看。", "caption": "同一个人可能下过好几单，命中后还要接着看。", "source_ids": ["cluster", "tree"]}
{"type": "html_motion", "id": "move-secondary-2", "scene_id": "secondary", "target": "secondary-view", "planned_start_ms": 155412, "planned_end_ms": 163602, "start_anchor": {"speak_id": "secondary-2a", "point": "start"}, "end_anchor": {"speak_id": "secondary-2b", "point": "end"}}
{"type": "speak", "id": "secondary-3a", "scene_id": "secondary", "planned_start_ms": 163602, "planned_end_ms": 168642, "text": "两条记录的客户号都是七，各带主键四十二和四十九。", "caption": "两条记录的客户号都是 7，各带主键42和49。", "source_ids": ["cluster", "tree"]}
